{"3513320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brawlers Tavern", "steam_appid": 3513320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure like Link and party like Mario. Brawl your way through ranked arenas, sports-style game modes, and monthly tournaments streamed live on Twitch.  Customize your look and abilities, meet friends, and dive into minigames or go on adventures together. Form guilds and wage wars to progress on the leaderboard from bronze to grandmaster. Whether you’re here to brawl or banter, the tavern is always open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/3865196782d4ac64baf1459fcfc255fb.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the arena! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight in front of the crowd to earn your rank, fame, and rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/02cfffce646a45b3d4ad2407c8cc50e0.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/02cfffce646a45b3d4ad2407c8cc50e0.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/02cfffce646a45b3d4ad2407c8cc50e0.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/84504fae8dd4f595e2909a32712f74cf.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=299 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join leagues and tournaments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play a variety of classic sport adaptations, like Brawl Ball, Foot Brawl and Dodge Ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/04bc09d77f1cef8f6f39510c2924f417.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/04bc09d77f1cef8f6f39510c2924f417.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/04bc09d77f1cef8f6f39510c2924f417.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/81d39b1d01c78ebeb8d0d658b9b25e60.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join a formidable guild or start your own</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wage war against rival guilds, conquer castles, towns and taverns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/3fcc7400f4241c464de9581ad8daccd1.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/3fcc7400f4241c464de9581ad8daccd1.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src