/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/223f0ab02aabe2e684d0f5bf2071752a.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/223f0ab02aabe2e684d0f5bf2071752a.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/223f0ab02aabe2e684d0f5bf2071752a.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/67774ddd8382b2bc64bf56a2e1bf2936.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=309 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore beyond the tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go on adventures and quest with friends, putting your skill and wit to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/f999cdd304ea2a68c96f441585baf6fa.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=337 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own brawler archetype</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip a set of 4 unique abilities. What will you become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps an untouchable ranger that sets up traps and summons a pet to fight alongside you, or a teleporting mage that controls the battlefield with a mix of ice and fire. If convention doesn't speak to you, you can play as a stealthy rogue that runs around healing and resurrecting allies or create your own class!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/c8e5ad4451680ffcf8c591cb0e656bc3.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the Tavern Games and festivities! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or coordinate with a team in dozens of fun engaging game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Tournaments</strong> - Watch or brawl live for glory and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ELO Rating System -</strong> Progress from bronze to grandmaster+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Shop -</strong> All items are purchasable with currency earned in-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair Play</strong> - No grind or pay-to-win. Just skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong> - Easy to pick up, glorifying to truly master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World -</strong> Explore beyond the tavern and uncover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests -</strong> Embark on solo or co-op adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong> - Play on mobile or PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Customization</strong> - Design and submit your own guild outfits and emblems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode &amp; Replays</strong> - Watch live matches or re-watch past matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong> - More variety and game modes to come.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Tavern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure like Link and party like Mario. Brawl your way through ranked arenas, sports-style game modes, and monthly tournaments streamed live on Twitch.  Customize your look and abilities, meet friends, and dive into minigames or go on adventures together. Form guilds and wage wars to progress on the leaderboard from bronze to grandmaster. Whether you’re here to brawl or banter, the tavern is always open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/3865196782d4ac64baf1459fcfc255fb.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter the arena! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight in front of the crowd to earn your r