om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/7be1140a1537deee53cd4957ccf8f9a3.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/f999cdd304ea2a68c96f441585baf6fa.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=337 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own brawler archetype</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equip a set of 4 unique abilities. What will you become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps an untouchable ranger that sets up traps and summons a pet to fight alongside you, or a teleporting mage that controls the battlefield with a mix of ice and fire. If convention doesn't speak to you, you can play as a stealthy rogue that runs around healing and resurrecting allies or create your own class!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/c8e5ad4451680ffcf8c591cb0e656bc3.avif?t=1768555417\" width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the Tavern Games and festivities! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or coordinate with a team in dozens of fun engaging game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.poster.avif?t=1768555417\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.webm?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513320/extras/984dc014104d3f606d30a22abd7eff7f.mp4?t=1768555417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Tournaments</strong> - Watch or brawl live for glory and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ELO Rating System -</strong> Progress from bronze to grandmaster+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Shop -</strong> All items are purchasable with currency earned in-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair Play</strong> - No grind or pay-to-win. Just skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong> - Easy to pick up, glorifying to truly master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World -</strong> Explore beyond the tavern and uncover new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests -</strong> Embark on solo or co-op adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong> - Play on mobile or PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Customization</strong> - Design and submit your own guild outfits and emblems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode &amp; Replays</strong> - Watch live matches or re-watch past matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong> - More variety and game modes to come.</p>", "short_description": "Enter the Tavern! Compete in arenas, brawl sports, and tournaments. Customize your look &amp; abilities, socialize, form guilds, c